{"seq":1,"slug":"identity-device-fingerprint-signal-model","title":"身份与设备指纹信号建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/realtime-payment-fraud-decisioning-risk-engine/signals-features-identity-device-graph/identity-device-fingerprint-signal-model","wordCount":3088,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"身份与设备指纹信号建模\">身份与设备指纹信号建模</h1><p>一笔授权请求抵达风控决策点时，携带的远不只是金额与卡号：还有账户的注册时间与改密史、浏览器渲染出的 Canvas 与 WebGL 哈希、Google Play Integrity 的判定结果、出口 IP 的自治域（ASN）与代理标注，以及这台设备在过去 30 天里关联过多少个账户。把原始观测变成规则引擎与评分模型都能消费的<strong>特征</strong>，是实时反欺诈里最耗工程、也最决定判别上限的一层。本文讨论身份与设备指纹两类信号的判别力、采集归一化、图谱化与隐私约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>反欺诈信号按<strong>来源实体</strong>切成四条线：身份、设备、环境、行为。决策引擎（见 <a href=\"../decision-engine-rules-model-fusion/\">决策引擎：规则、模型与评分融合</a>）输出的风险分，本质是这四类特征加权融合的结果。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Req[授权请求] --&gt; IDN[身份信号&lt;br/&gt;账户年龄/邮箱/手机]&#10;  Req --&gt; DEV[设备信号&lt;br/&gt;浏览器指纹/完整性证明]&#10;  Req --&gt; ENV[环境信号&lt;br/&gt;IP/ASN/TLS 指纹]&#10;  Req --&gt; BEH[行为信号&lt;br/&gt;击键/轨迹/时序]&#10;  IDN --&gt; FEAT[特征化&lt;br/&gt;归一/哈希/窗口聚合]&#10;  DEV --&gt; FEAT&#10;  ENV --&gt; FEAT&#10;  BEH --&gt; FEAT&#10;  FEAT --&gt; GRAPH[实体图谱&lt;br/&gt;设备-账户-卡-邮箱]&#10;  GRAPH --&gt; MODEL[评分与规则融合]&#10;  FEAT --&gt; MODEL&#10;  MODEL --&gt; DEC{实时决策&lt;br/&gt;通过/挑战/拒绝}&#10;  DEC --&gt;|拒绝或人工| OPS[案件评审与标签回流]&#10;  OPS -.标签延迟.-&gt; GRAPH\">graph TD\n  Req[授权请求] --&gt; IDN[身份信号&lt;br/&gt;账户年龄/邮箱/手机]\n  Req --&gt; DEV[设备信号&lt;br/&gt;浏览器指纹/完整性证明]\n  Req --&gt; ENV[环境信号&lt;br/&gt;IP/ASN/TLS 指纹]\n  Req --&gt; BEH[行为信号&lt;br/&gt;击键/轨迹/时序]\n  IDN --&gt; FEAT[特征化&lt;br/&gt;归一/哈希/窗口聚合]\n  DEV --&gt; FEAT\n  ENV --&gt; FEAT\n  BEH --&gt; FEAT\n  FEAT --&gt; GRAPH[实体图谱&lt;br/&gt;设备-账户-卡-邮箱]\n  GRAPH --&gt; MODEL[评分与规则融合]\n  FEAT --&gt; MODEL\n  MODEL --&gt; DEC{实时决策&lt;br/&gt;通过/挑战/拒绝}\n  DEC --&gt;|拒绝或人工| OPS[案件评审与标签回流]\n  OPS -.标签延迟.-&gt; GRAPH</pre><p>四条线的区别在<strong>伪造成本</strong>与<strong>归因强度</strong>。IP 可换代理、邮箱可批量注册，而真实设备要同时伪装浏览器指纹并通过平台级完整性证明的成本高得多；反过来设备标识极易被重装、重置或&quot;设备农场&quot;伪造。单一信号都不可靠，价值来自跨信号<strong>一致性检验</strong>——&quot;新设备 + 新账户 + 高价值 + 数据中心 IP&quot;的欺诈率远高于任一单点加总。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号类别</th>\n<th>典型来源</th>\n<th>判别力</th>\n<th>规避成本</th>\n<th>稳定性</th>\n<th>主要合规约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>身份信号</td>\n<td>账户、邮箱、手机、地址、绑卡史</td>\n<td>中（延迟暴露）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>GDPR 最小化、PIPL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备指纹</td>\n<td>浏览器熵、SDK 采集、完整性证明</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中—高</td>\n<td>中（重置即失效）</td>\n<td>ePrivacy 同意、ATT/GAID</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络环境</td>\n<td>IP 情报、ASN、TLS/JA4 指纹</td>\n<td>中—高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低（秒级漂移）</td>\n<td>日志留存与跨境传输</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为</td>\n<td>击键、触控、停留、会话时序</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>通常按匿名会话处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"身份信号-账户-联系方式与归属冲突\">身份信号：账户、联系方式与归属冲突</h2><p>身份信号的价值不在单字段，而在<strong>字段之间的冲突与历史</strong>。同一个邮箱第一次出现在平台却 5 分钟内下了 800 美元订单，与注册两年、有 40 笔成功还款记录的账户，是完全不同的风险画像。身份特征的核心是三组量：<strong>存在时长</strong>（账户年龄、邮箱/手机首次出现天数）、<strong>绑定强度</strong>（是否验证邮箱与手机、有无历史支付成功）、<strong>变更速率</strong>（近期改密、改绑、改收货地址次数）。\n联系方式可做低成本风险标注：一次性邮箱域名、别名子地址（<code>user+tag@domain</code> 的 tag 剥离）、本地部分是否含随机串。手机号侧，跨境场景要区分<strong>号码归属地与收货地/持卡行所在国</strong>是否一致，并留意换号（SIM swap）信号——它是账户接管（ATO）后劫持短信 OTP 的经典手法，常以&quot;最近换号天数&quot;入模。</p>\n<p>速率类特征按<strong>实体维度 × 时间窗口</strong>展开。设实体 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 在窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 内的请求计数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{e,\\Delta t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，最常用的是队列标准分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>cohort</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mtext>cohort</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_{e} = \\frac{n_{e,\\Delta t} - \\mu_{\\text{cohort}}}{\\sigma_{\\text{cohort}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cohort</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cohort</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu,\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 取同一商户/卡种/地区的同期基线。用绝对值会让促销期全量误杀，队列标准分才能表达&quot;这个账户相对同类异常得多&quot;。身份信号的结构性缺陷是<strong>标签延迟</strong>——账户年龄要存活足够久才有意义，欺诈者正是利用&quot;新账户灰度期&quot;作案，因此身份特征必须与设备、环境特征联合使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"设备指纹-浏览器熵与移动端完整性证明\">设备指纹：浏览器熵与移动端完整性证明</h2><p>设备指纹的目标是给&quot;同一台物理终端&quot;一个可复用的标识，即使 Cookie 被清除。做法是采集一组<strong>高熵属性</strong>并做稳定化组合：Canvas 渲染像素差异、WebGL 渲染器与扩展、已安装字体集合、AudioContext 浮点差异、屏幕与硬件参数、时区与语言。EFF 的 Cover Your Tracks（原 Panopticlick）长期观测显示，高熵使大量用户落入几乎唯一的组合。指纹质量用位熵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 与 JS 散度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>J</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{JS}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 衡量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>J</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(X) = -\\sum_{i} p_i \\log_2 p_i, \\qquad D_{JS}(P \\| Q) = \\tfrac{1}{2} D_{KL}(P\\|M) + \\tfrac{1}{2} D_{KL}(Q\\|M),\\ M=\\tfrac{P+Q}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=