an></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2694em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9244em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">Q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 越大越能区分设备，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>J</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{JS}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越小说明同一设备跨会话越稳定——两者要一起优化，只追高熵会得到&quot;每次都不一样的噪声&quot;。实践中还要做<strong>组合稳定性</strong>：单属性会变（外接显示器改变分辨率），中位数投票把一组属性拼成可容忍扰动的主键。</p>\n<p>移动端是另一个世界。iOS 浏览器与 App 都不能读硬件序列号，可依赖的是 <strong>DeviceCheck / App Attest</strong>（Apple，<code>developer.apple.com/documentation/devicecheck</code>）：App Attest 用 Secure Enclave 生成密钥并由 Apple 证明 App 未被篡改。Android 侧对应 <strong>Google Play Integrity API</strong>（<code>developer.android.com/google/play/integrity</code>），自 2022 年起取代已废弃的 SafetyNet，返回 <code>MEETS_DEVICE_INTEGRITY</code>、<code>MEETS_STRONG_INTEGRITY</code> 等判定，可识别 root、被篡改 App 与非常规环境。Apple 自 iOS 14.5 起实施 <strong>ATT</strong>，跨 App 追踪需显式授权；Android 允许删除广告 ID。移动端因此<strong>不能再依赖 IDFA/GAID 做长期标识</strong>，而要靠平台完整性证明 + 自建设备图 + 服务端设备凭证。</p>\n<p>第三类是自建设备凭证：首次访问时由服务端下发 HMAC 签名的设备 Token，存入页面脚本读不到的位置（HttpOnly Cookie 或原生安全存储），后续携带校验。它不防伪，但让<strong>清缓存、换浏览器不至于丢失设备身份</strong>，把指纹噪声降下来。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指纹手段</th>\n<th>抗清缓存</th>\n<th>抗伪造</th>\n<th>关键限制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Canvas/WebGL 组合</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>隐私浏览器会随机化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务端签名设备 Token</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>需首访建立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>App Attest / DeviceCheck</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>需 App 内、有配额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Play Integrity</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>依赖 Google 服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IDFA / GAID</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>ATT/可删除后失效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"网络与行为信号-ip-情报-tls-与协议栈指纹\">网络与行为信号：IP 情报、TLS 与协议栈指纹</h2><p>环境信号是设备指纹的补充，且<strong>不受客户端配合度影响</strong>——服务端在握手阶段就能被动采集。IP 情报维度包括 ASN 与运营商类型（住宅/移动/数据中心/教育）、地理定位、是否命中公开代理/VPN/Tor 出口列表、历史欺诈标注；数据中心与托管 ASN 的订单欺诈率显著高于住宅，是少数可直接入规则的单点。\n协议栈指纹更进一步。<strong>JA3</strong>（Salesforce，2017）把 TLS ClientHello 的版本、密码套件、扩展与曲线拼成字符串再哈希，产出可跨 IP 复用的客户端指纹；<strong>JA4+</strong>（FoxIO，2023，<code>github.com/FoxIO-LLC/ja4</code>）修正了 JA3 对扩展顺序敏感的问题并扩展到 HTTP。其价值在于<strong>这些信号由真实网络栈产生，脚本化批量攻击的 TLS 指纹常与真实浏览器不同</strong>，从而在设备指纹被伪造时仍留痕。</p>\n<p>行为信号通常按匿名会话处理，含击键节奏、触控轨迹、停留时长、填写顺序。其隐私敏感度低，但<strong>判别力依赖个体化基线</strong>，冷启动用户上几乎无效；稳妥用法是检测异常模式（粘贴卡号、极短停留、匀速操作）而非建立画像。</p>\n<h2 id=\"图谱特征-实体解析与团伙识别\">图谱特征：实体解析与团伙识别</h2><p>把上述信号串起来的，是实体图谱：节点是设备、账户、邮箱、手机、卡、收货地址、IP，边是观测到的共现关系。图上最有价值的两类特征，一是<strong>连通度</strong>，二是<strong>社群结构</strong>。</p>\n<p>连通度直接可算：一个设备关联的账户数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>deg</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mtext>acct</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\deg_{\\text{acct}}(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">de<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">acct</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、一个收货地址聚集的下单账户数、一个 IP 覆盖的卡号数。欺诈团伙的典型形态是&quot;一设备多账户&quot;&quot;一地址多卡&quot;&quot;多账户共用退回地址&quot;——这些在单笔视角下全部正常，只有全局计数才暴露。</p>\n<p>社群结构用于识别<strong>有组织的团伙</strong>，而非零散的个体欺诈。常用方法是在图谱上跑社区发现：Louvain（Blondel 等，2008）以模块度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 为优化目标做层次聚类，标签传播（Raghavan 等，2007）以近线性时间做近似划分。模块度定义为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q = \\frac{1}{2m}\\sum_{ij}\\left(A_{ij} - \\frac{k_i k_j}{2m}\\right)\\delta(c_i, c_j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>另一条路线是图神经网络（GraphSAGE，Hamilton 等，2017），把节点属性与邻居结构编码为嵌入向量，再喂给下游评分模型。</p>\n<p>图谱工程有三条硬约束。<strong>实体解析先于图谱</strong>：邮箱别名、手机国家码、地址规范化没做好，图就是碎的，Fellegi-Sunter 概率模型是通用框架。<strong>图必须在线可查</strong>：实时决策要求毫秒级拿到节点度数，邻接关系通常落在 Redis 或内存图层。<strong>图的时效由边决定</strong>：一条&quot;某设备今天关联了第 9 个账户&quot;的边价值在几小时内就衰减，必须以流式方式增量更新。</p>\n<h2 id=\"隐私合规与信号治理\">隐私合规与信号治理</h2><p>合规边界直接决定哪些特征可采、可存、可跨区域传输。欧盟 <strong>ePrivacy 指令</strong>（2002/58/EC 第 5(3) 条）要求访问终端存储信息（Cookie、本地存储、指纹脚本）前取得同意，<strong>GDPR</strong> 第 5(1)(c) 条要求采集限于&quot;实现目的所必需&quot;。美国 <strong>CCPA/CPRA</strong>（2023 年 1 月 1 日生效）赋予删除与退出权，可被推导为设备标识的字段都落入范围；中国 <strong>PIPL</strong> 对个人信息跨境提供另有专门要求。指纹信号本身不属支付卡数据，但若与 PAN 关联存储，就落进 <strong>PCI DSS v4.0.1</strong>（PCI SSC，2024）的持卡人数据环境（CDE）合规范围。</p>\n<p>工程落地原则是<strong>最小化 + 单向化 + 分域</strong>：只采判别必需字段；对邮箱、手机号等直接标识符用带盐的 HMAC 而非明文或裸哈希（裸哈希可被彩虹表攻击），盐值按商户或区域分域以阻断跨域关联；原始信号与派生特征分离存放，按最短必要期留存。一个常被忽略的对抗点：<strong>加盐哈希后的标识符仍是稳定连接键</strong>，若盐值可枚举或与外部数据集交叉，去匿名化仍然可能。</p>\n<p>治理还包括<strong>反馈回路的偏差控制</strong>。被规则拦下的交易不产生真实结果标签，模型只在放行样本上学习，长期会低估被拦截群体的欺诈率。缓解手段是保留小比例随机放行做对照组，把人工案件评审结论（见 <a href=\"../review-ops-guarantee-feedback-loop/\">评审运营与保障反馈回路</a>）作为高质量标签回流，并监控入模特征的分布漂移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>反欺诈信号分四条线（身份、设备、环境、行为），判别力来自<strong>跨信号一致性</strong>而非任一单点；伪造成本越高的信号（平台完整性证明、协议栈指纹）越应作为最终裁决依据。</li>\n<li>身份特征的关键是存在时长、绑定强度、变更速率与队列标准分化的速度异常；其弱点是标签延迟，须与设备/环境联合建模。</li>\n<li>设备指纹要同时优化区分度（位熵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>）与稳定性（JS 散度）；移动端在 ATT/GAID 受限后，长期标识依赖 App Attest、Play Integrity 与自建服务端设备凭证的组合。</li>\n<li>IP 情报与 JA3/JA4 协议栈指纹是服务端被动可得、客户端无法配合伪造的环境信号，适合直接入规则。</li>\n<li>图谱把离散信号变成团伙证据：度数发现&quot;一设备多账户&quot;，社区发现（Louvain / 标签传播 / GraphSAGE）识别有组织欺诈；实体解析质量决定图谱上限，在线低延迟查询决定其可用性。</li>\n<li>合规是特征设计的约束条件：ePrivacy 同意、GDPR 最小化、CCPA/CPRA 删除权、PIPL 与 PCI DSS 共同限定采集范围与留存；加盐 HMAC 优于裸哈希，反馈回路偏差需随机对照组与人工评审标签回流来纠正。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"身份与设备指纹信号建模","id":"身份与设备指纹信号建模"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"身份信号：账户、联系方式与归属冲突","id":"身份信号-账户-联系方式与归属冲突"},{"level":2,"text":"设备指纹：浏览器熵与移动端完整性证明","id":"设备指纹-浏览器熵与移动端完整性证明"},{"level":2,"text":"网络与行为信号：IP 情报、TLS 与协议栈指纹","id":"网络与行为信号-ip-情报-tls-与协议栈指纹"},{"level":2,"text":"图谱特征：实体解析与团伙识别","id":"图谱特征-实体解析与团伙识别"},{"level":2,"text":"隐私合规与信号治理","id":"隐私合规与信号治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"风险分层、阈值策略与评分配置治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/realtime-payment-fraud-decisioning-risk-engine/fraud-taxonomy-decision-economics/risk-tier-threshold-policy-calibration"},"next":{"title":"行为生物特征与速度/时序特征工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/realtime-payment-fraud-decisioning-risk-engine/signals-features-identity-device-graph/behavioral-velocity-temporal-features"}}